  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/MfbDTCK/random-mob-sizes-banner.png\" alt=\"隨機生物尺寸\" width=\"1600\" height=\"600\"></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">讓您可以設定生物以不同尺寸生成</span></h4><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nRZZ43X/divider-dark-green.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"15\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">根據設定，生物將會以隨機尺寸生成。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/RandomMobSizes/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基頁面</a> &nbsp;以獲得更多關於如何設定此模組的資訊。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nRZZ43X/divider-dark-green.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"15\"> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您對這個模組有任何疑問，或是想了解即將推出的功能：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎加入我的&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"> </a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a> </span></p>",
